<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 9.</p>
<p>				    June 9/June 6   June 9/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.07		 6.91</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.07		 5.30</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.01		10.02</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.03		52.12</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.80		33.06</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.83		33.62</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		12.96</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.01		29.55</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.86		40.57</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.91		39.20</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		21.76</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.05		92.75</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,345,923,480,441</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,942,861,871,364</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,070,875,980,848</p>
<p>  International funds			    95,720,894,337</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    236,464,733,890</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
